{
  "page": 577,
  "lang": "ar",
  "edition": "quran-uthmani",
  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 5543,
      "text": "Maka tidak berguna lagi bagi mereka syafaat (pertolongan) dari orang-orang yang memberikan syafaat.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 74,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُدَّثِّرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muddaththir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cloaked One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 56,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 48,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 577,
      "ruku": 511,
      "hizbQuarter": 230,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5544,
      "text": "Lalu mengapa mereka (orang-orang kafir) berpaling dari peringatan (Allah)?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 74,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُدَّثِّرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muddaththir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cloaked One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 56,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 49,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 577,
      "ruku": 511,
      "hizbQuarter": 230,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5545,
      "text": "seakan-akan mereka keledai liar yang lari terkejut,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 74,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُدَّثِّرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muddaththir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cloaked One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 56,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 50,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 577,
      "ruku": 511,
      "hizbQuarter": 230,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5546,
      "text": "lari dari singa.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 74,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُدَّثِّرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muddaththir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cloaked One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 56,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 51,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 577,
      "ruku": 511,
      "hizbQuarter": 230,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5547,
      "text": "Bahkan setiap orang dari mereka ingin agar diberikan kepadanya lembaran-lembaran (kitab) yang terbuka.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 74,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُدَّثِّرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muddaththir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cloaked One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 56,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 52,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 577,
      "ruku": 511,
      "hizbQuarter": 230,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5548,
      "text": "Tidak! Sebenarnya mereka tidak takut kepada akhirat.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 74,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُدَّثِّرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muddaththir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cloaked One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 56,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 53,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 577,
      "ruku": 511,
      "hizbQuarter": 230,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5549,
      "text": "Tidak! Sesungguhnya (Al-Qur`an) itu benar-benar suatu peringatan.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 74,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُدَّثِّرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muddaththir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cloaked One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 56,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 54,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 577,
      "ruku": 511,
      "hizbQuarter": 230,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5550,
      "text": "Maka barangsiapa menghendaki, tentu dia mengambil pelajaran darinya.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 74,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُدَّثِّرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muddaththir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cloaked One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 56,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 55,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 577,
      "ruku": 511,
      "hizbQuarter": 230,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5551,
      "text": "Dan mereka tidak akan mengambil pelajaran darinya (Al-Qur`an) kecuali (jika) Allah menghendakinya. Dialah Tuhan yang patut (kita) bertakwa kepada-Nya dan yang berhak memberi ampun.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 74,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُدَّثِّرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muddaththir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cloaked One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 56,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 56,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 577,
      "ruku": 511,
      "hizbQuarter": 230,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5552,
      "text": "Aku bersumpah dengan hari Kiamat,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 75,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القِيَامَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qiyaama",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Resurrection",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 1,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 577,
      "ruku": 512,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5553,
      "text": "dan aku bersumpah demi jiwa yang selalu menyesali (dirinya sendiri).",
      "surah": {
        "number": 75,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القِيَامَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qiyaama",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Resurrection",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 2,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 577,
      "ruku": 512,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5554,
      "text": "Apakah manusia mengira, bahwa Kami tidak akan mengumpulkan (kembali) tulang belulangnya?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 75,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القِيَامَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qiyaama",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Resurrection",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 3,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 577,
      "ruku": 512,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5555,
      "text": "(Bahkan) Kami mampu menyusun (kembali) jari jemarinya dengan sempurna.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 75,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القِيَامَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qiyaama",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Resurrection",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 4,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 577,
      "ruku": 512,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5556,
      "text": "Tetapi manusia hendak membuat maksiat terus menerus.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 75,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القِيَامَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qiyaama",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Resurrection",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 5,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 577,
      "ruku": 512,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5557,
      "text": "Dia bertanya, \"Kapankah hari Kiamat itu?\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 75,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القِيَامَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qiyaama",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Resurrection",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 6,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 577,
      "ruku": 512,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5558,
      "text": "Maka apabila mata terbelalak (ketakutan),",
      "surah": {
        "number": 75,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القِيَامَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qiyaama",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Resurrection",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 7,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 577,
      "ruku": 512,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5559,
      "text": "dan bulan pun telah hilang cahayanya,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 75,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القِيَامَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qiyaama",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Resurrection",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 8,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 577,
      "ruku": 512,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5560,
      "text": "lalu matahari dan bulan dikumpulkan,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 75,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القِيَامَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qiyaama",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Resurrection",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 9,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 577,
      "ruku": 512,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5561,
      "text": "pada hari itu manusia berkata, \"Ke mana tempat pelarian?\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 75,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القِيَامَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qiyaama",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Resurrection",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 10,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 577,
      "ruku": 512,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5562,
      "text": "Tidak! Tidak ada tempat berlindung!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 75,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القِيَامَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qiyaama",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Resurrection",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 11,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 577,
      "ruku": 512,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5563,
      "text": "Hanya kepada Tuhanmu tempat kembali pada hari itu.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 75,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القِيَامَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qiyaama",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Resurrection",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 12,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 577,
      "ruku": 512,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5564,
      "text": "Pada hari itu diberitakan kepada manusia apa yang telah dikerjakannya dan apa yang dilalaikannya.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 75,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القِيَامَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qiyaama",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Resurrection",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 13,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 577,
      "ruku": 512,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5565,
      "text": "Bahkan manusia menjadi saksi atas dirinya sendiri,880)",
      "surah": {
        "number": 75,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القِيَامَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qiyaama",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Resurrection",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 14,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 577,
      "ruku": 512,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5566,
      "text": "dan meskipun dia mengemukakan alasan-alasannya.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 75,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القِيَامَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qiyaama",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Resurrection",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 15,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 577,
      "ruku": 512,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5567,
      "text": "Jangan engkau (Muhammad) gerakkan lidahmu (untuk membaca Al-Qur`an) karena hendak cepat-cepat (menguasai)nya.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 75,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القِيَامَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qiyaama",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Resurrection",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 16,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 577,
      "ruku": 512,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5568,
      "text": "Sesungguhnya Kami yang akan mengumpulkannya (di dadamu) dan membacakannya.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 75,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القِيَامَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qiyaama",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Resurrection",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 17,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 577,
      "ruku": 512,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5569,
      "text": "Apabila Kami telah selesai membacakannya maka ikutilah bacaannya itu.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 75,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القِيَامَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qiyaama",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Resurrection",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 18,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 577,
      "ruku": 512,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5570,
      "text": "Kemudian sesungguhnya Kami yang akan menjelaskannya.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 75,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القِيَامَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qiyaama",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Resurrection",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 19,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 577,
      "ruku": 512,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    }
  ],
  "language": "id"
}
